.head 3 +  Function: fSambandskontroll			! Sambandskontroll urval SCCP
.head 4 -  Description: =====================================================
Syntax:		bOk = fSambandskontroll( )

Exempel:		If fSambandskontroll( )
		  .......

Beskrivning: 	Sambandskontroll urval SCCP

Parametrar:	-

Returnerar:	bOk		True eller False
ƒndringslogg
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Datum		ƒndrat av		Beskrivning
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
10-06-18		Anders	First/Second choice kr‰vs inte l‰ngre ihop med Site/Spc/Provider.
			Inget choice ska av l‰sprocedur tolkas som alla choice.
10-09-06		Anders	S‰tt Ni fˆr k‰nd Dec + KontrollfrÂga om Ni saknas
=====================================================
.head 4 +  Returns
.head 5 -  Boolean:
.head 4 -  Parameters
.head 4 -  Static Variables
.head 4 +  Local variables
.head 5 -  Boolean: bOk
.head 4 +  Actions
.head 5 -  Call SalWaitCursor( True )
.head 5 -  !
.head 5 -  ! --------------- Initierar lokala variabler
.head 5 -  Set bOk = False
.head 5 -  !
.head 5 -  !
.head 5 -  ! --------------- Kontrollerar fˆnsterkomponenternas samband
.head 5 -  !
.head 5 -  ! Urvalskombination 1 - Urval ovan linjen
.head 5 +  If hWndForm.cmbCountry	!= '' 
Or hWndForm.cmbCountryAbbr != '' 
Or hWndForm.cmbCountryCode != ''
Or hWndForm.cmbOperator != '' 
Or hWndForm.cmbIMSIcode != '' 
Or hWndForm.dfsNP1 != ''
Or hWndForm.cmbNP7 != ''  
Or hWndForm.dfnFom != NUMBER_Null
Or hWndForm.dfnTom != NUMBER_Null 
Or hWndForm.cmbStatus != ''
.head 6 -  Set bOk = True
.head 6 -  Set hWndForm.nUrvalsKombination = 1
.head 5 -  !
.head 5 -  ! Urvalskombination 2 - SPC   
.head 5 +  Else If hWndForm.dfnSpcN != NUMBER_Null 
Or hWndForm.dfnSpcU != NUMBER_Null
Or hWndForm.dfnSpcM != NUMBER_Null
Or hWndForm.dfnSpcNi != NUMBER_Null
Or hWndForm.dfnSpcDec != NUMBER_Null
.head 6 -  Set bOk = True
.head 6 -  Set hWndForm.nUrvalsKombination = 2
.head 5 -  !
.head 5 -  ! Urvalskombination 3 - Site  
.head 5 +  Else If hWndForm.cmbSiteCode != ''  
Or hWndForm.cmbSiteType != '' 
Or hWndForm.cmbSiteTypeNo != ''
.head 6 -  Set bOk = True
.head 6 -  Set hWndForm.nUrvalsKombination = 3
.head 5 -  !
.head 5 -  ! Urvalskombination 4 - Provider  
.head 5 +  Else If hWndForm.cmbProvider != ''
.head 6 -  Set bOk = True
.head 6 -  Set hWndForm.nUrvalsKombination = 4
.head 5 -  !
.head 5 +  If bOk = False
.head 6 -  Call fVisaMeddelande( Msg_Validering_Ok, '', MsgNr_Gen4 )
.head 5 +  Else
.head 6 +  If hWndForm.nUrvalsKombination = 2 And
hWndForm.dfnSpcDec != NUMBER_Null And hWndForm.dfnSpcNi = NUMBER_Null
.head 7 +  If SalMessageBox ( 
'NI has not been specified, 
Continue anyway OK 
or 
Return to selection window Cancel',
MsgRubrik_FrÂga, MB_OkCancel ) = IDCANCEL
.head 8 -  Set bOk = False
.head 5 -  !
.head 5 -  Call SalWaitCursor( False )
.head 5 -  Return bOk
